<cell>
<cname>Al_Capp</cname>
<text>My work is being destroyed almost as soon as it is printed.  One day it is being read; the next day someone's wrapping fish in it.
</text></cell>
<cell>
<cname>Duc_De_La_Rochenfoucauld</cname>
<text>If we had no faults, we should not take so much pleasure in noticing them in others.</text></cell>
<cell>
<cname>Emerson</cname>
<text>A foolish consistency is the hobgoblin of little minds...</text></cell>
<cell>
<cname>GeorgeBernardShaw</cname>
<text>You never can tell...</text></cell>
<cell>
<cname>home</cname>
<text>Home is where the heart is.
There's no place like home..</text></cell>
<cell>
<cname>Lao_Tzu</cname>
<text>He who knows does not speak.

He who speaks does not know.</text></cell>
<cell>
<cname>RichardIII</cname>
<text>Now is the Winter of our discontent
made bright Summer by this Sun of York;
And all the clouds that lour'd upon our house
in the deep bosom of the ocean buried  :{
</text></cell>
<cell>
<cname>Rumi</cname>
<text>I have lived on the lip of insanity,
wanting to know reasons, knocking
on a door.  It opens.
I've been knocking from the inside!</text></cell></eof>